  # Only the embedder that builds a renderer process needs this target, and
  # nothing may pull it into the browser process by accident.
  #
  # //taffy/test:browser_test_launcher is the fourth entry and it is
  # the same kind of thing as the first: it is a test binary's embedder half —
  # the ContentRendererClient that runs in taffy_browsertests' renderer
  # processes. It is NOT permission for tests generally, which is why the entry
  # names one target rather than the directory: //taffy/test's own
